<a href="#S6.SS5.p1.1" title="6.5 Probing and Attribution Methods ‣ 6 Related Work ‣ The Dual-Stream Transformer: Channelized Architecture for Interpretable Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§6.5</span></a>.
