<section id="S8.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">8.2 </span>Forward Pass Pseudocode</h3>

<div id="S8.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ 8.2 Forward Pass Pseudocode ‣ 8 Complete Architecture Specification ‣ The Dual-Stream Transformer: Channelized Architecture for Interpretable Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> presents the complete forward pass for <span id="S8.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Token-Factor</span> mode with configurable mixing.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Dual-Stream Transformer Forward Pass (<span id="alg1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Token-Factor</span> mode)</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
              
              
             Input tokens <math id="alg1.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{t}\in\mathbb{N}^{B\times T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐭</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{t}\in\mathbb{N}^{B\times T}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0a.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
              
              
             Output logits <math id="alg1.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{y}\in\mathbb{R}^{B\times T\times V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{y}\in\mathbb{R}^{B\times T\times V}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
              
              
             <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(0)}\leftarrow\text{Embedding}(\mathbf{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Embedding</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐭</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(0)}\leftarrow\text{Embedding}(\mathbf{t})</annotation></semantics></math> {Initialize token stream}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
              
              
             <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(0)}\leftarrow\mathbf{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>𝟎</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(0)}\leftarrow\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math> {Initialize contextual stream}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell=0</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L-1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}^{(\ell)}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(\ell)}+\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(\ell)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}^{(\ell)}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(\ell)}+\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(\ell)}</annotation></semantics></math> {Combined stream}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
              {— Attention Block —}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{\text{norm}}\leftarrow\text{CLN}(\mathbf{x}^{(\ell)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>norm</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>CLN</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{\text{norm}}\leftarrow\text{CLN}(\mathbf{x}^{(\ell)})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{t,\text{norm}}\leftarrow\text{CLN}(\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(\ell)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>norm</mtext></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>CLN</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{t,\text{norm}}\leftarrow\text{CLN}(\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(\ell)})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q,K\leftarrow W_{Q}\mathbf{x}_{\text{norm}},W_{K}\mathbf{x}_{\text{norm}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>norm</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>norm</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q,K\leftarrow W_{Q}\mathbf{x}_{\text{norm}},W_{K}\mathbf{x}_{\text{norm}}</annotation></semantics></math> {Dense Q/K}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V\leftarrow\text{MixingLinear}_{V}(\mathbf{x}_{t,\text{norm}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mtext>MixingLinear</mtext><mi>V</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>norm</mtext></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V\leftarrow\text{MixingLinear}_{V}(\mathbf{x}_{t,\text{norm}})</annotation></semantics></math> {Configurable V mixing}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A\leftarrow\text{softmax}(QK^{\top}/\sqrt{d_{h}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A\leftarrow\text{softmax}(QK^{\top}/\sqrt{d_{h}})</annotation></semantics></math> {Attention weights}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{a}_{\text{out}}\leftarrow\text{MixingLinear}_{O}(A\cdot V)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mtext>MixingLinear</mtext><mi>O</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{a}_{\text{out}}\leftarrow\text{MixingLinear}_{O}(A\cdot V)</annotation></semantics></math> {Configurable output mixing}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(\ell+1)}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(\ell)}+\mathbf{a}_{\text{out}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(\ell+1)}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(\ell)}+\mathbf{a}_{\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math> {Update token stream}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
              
              
              {— FFN Block —}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}^{(\ell+1)}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(\ell+1)}+\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(\ell)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}^{(\ell+1)}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(\ell+1)}+\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(\ell)}</annotation></semantics></math> {Recompute combined}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{\text{norm}}\leftarrow\text{CLN}(\mathbf{x}^{(\ell+1)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>norm</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>CLN</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{\text{norm}}\leftarrow\text{CLN}(\mathbf{x}^{(\ell+1)})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">16:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{h}\leftarrow\text{GELU}(\text{MixingLinear}_{\text{up}}(\mathbf{x}_{\text{norm}}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐡</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>GELU</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mtext>MixingLinear</mtext><mtext>up</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>norm</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{h}\leftarrow\text{GELU}(\text{MixingLinear}_{\text{up}}(\mathbf{x}_{\text{norm}}))</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">17:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{f}_{\text{out}}\leftarrow\text{MixingLinear}_{\text{down}}(\mathbf{h})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐟</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mtext>MixingLinear</mtext><mtext>down</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐡</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{f}_{\text{out}}\leftarrow\text{MixingLinear}_{\text{down}}(\mathbf{h})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">18:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(\ell+1)}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(\ell)}+\mathbf{f}_{\text{out}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐟</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(\ell+1)}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(\ell)}+\mathbf{f}_{\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math> {Update contextual stream}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l19.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">19:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l19.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l20.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">20:</span></span>
              
              
             <math id="alg1.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{\text{final}}\leftarrow\text{LayerNorm}(\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(L)}+\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(L)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>LayerNorm</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{\text{final}}\leftarrow\text{LayerNorm}(\mathbf{x}_{t}^{(L)}+\mathbf{x}_{e}^{(L)})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l21.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">21:</span></span>
              
              
             <math id="alg1.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{y}\leftarrow W_{\text{lm\_head}}\mathbf{x}_{\text{final}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>lm_head</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{y}\leftarrow W_{\text{lm\_head}}\mathbf{x}_{\text{final}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l22.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">22:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span>  <math id="alg1.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐲</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{y}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S8.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">8.3 </span>Mixing Strategy Parameter Counts</h3>

<div id="S8.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S8.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ 8.3 Mixing Strategy Parameter Counts ‣ 8 Complete Architecture Specification ‣ The Dual-Stream Transformer: Channelized Architecture for Interpretable Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> compares parameter counts for each mixing strategy applied to a <math id="S8.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D\times D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D\times D</annotation></semantics></math> projection with <math id="S8.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>H</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H</annotation></semantics></math> heads.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S8.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Parameter counts for mixing strategies (<math id="S8.T7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D=512" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>512</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D=512</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S8.T7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H=8</annotation></semantics></math>).</figcaption>
<table id="S8.T7.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S8.T7.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S8.T7.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Strategy</th>
<th id="S8.T7.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Parameters</th>
<th id="S8.T7.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Example (<math id="S8.T7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D=512" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>512</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D=512</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S8.T7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H=8</annotation></semantics></math>)</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S8.T7.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S8.T7.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t"><span id="S8.T7.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Identity</span></th>
<td id="S8.T7.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">0</td>
<td id="S8.T7.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">0</td></tr>
<tr id="S8.T7.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S8.T7.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row"><span id="S8.T7.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Independent</span></th>
<td id="S8.T7.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><math id="S8.T7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H\cdot d_{h}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H\cdot d_{h}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S8.T7.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><math id="S8.T7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="8\times 64^{2}=32,768" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>64</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>32,768</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">8\times 64^{2}=32,768</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="S8.T7.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S8.T7.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row"><span id="S8.T7.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Kronecker</span></th>
<td id="S8.T7.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><math id="S8.T7.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S8.T7.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><math id="S8.T7.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="8^{2}=64" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">8^{2}=64</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="S8.T7.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S8.T7.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb"><span id="S8.T7.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Dense</span></th>
<td id="S8.T7.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><math id="S8.T7.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S8.T7.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><math id="S8.T7.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="512^{2}=262,144" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>512</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>262,144</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">512^{2}=262,144</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="S8.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Note that <span id="S8.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Kronecker</span> mixing is extremely parameter-efficient (<math id="S8.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H^{2}=64" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H^{2}=64</annotation></semantics></math> parameters vs. <math id="S8.SS3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D^{2}=262,144" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>262,144</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D^{2}=262,144</annotation></semantics></math> for Dense), while providing interpretable cross-head communication.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S9" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">9 </span>Training Details</h2>

<section id="S9.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">9.1 </span>Optimization</h3>

<div id="S9.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All models are trained with AdamW optimizer <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">Loshchilov and Hutter [2017]</a></cite> with the following settings:</p>
<ul id="S9.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S9.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Learning rate: <math id="S9.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math> with cosine annealing to <math id="S9.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 10^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S9.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Weight decay: 0.1</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S9.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Betas: <math id="S9.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(0.9,0.95)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0.9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.95</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(0.9,0.95)</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S9.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Gradient clipping: 1.0</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S9.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Warmup steps: 1000</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S9.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">9.2 </span>Training Configuration</h3>

<div id="S9.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="S9.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S9.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Batch size: 32 sequences</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S9.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Sequence length: 512 tokens</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S9.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Training samples: 2M</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S9.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Epochs: 2</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S9.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Floating point: Standard precision</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S9.I2.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I2.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I2.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Hardware: Single NVIDIA RTX 4090 (24GB)</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S9.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">9.3 </span>Per-Layer Supervision Settings</h3>

<div id="S9.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">When per-layer supervision is enabled:</p>
<ul id="S9.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S9.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Base weight <math id="S9.I3.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda=0.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda=0.1</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S9.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Layer weight decay: linear (layer <math id="S9.I3.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell</annotation></semantics></math> receives weight <math id="S9.I3.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell/L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell/L</annotation></semantics></math>)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S9.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S9.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Applied only during training, not validation</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S10" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">10 </span>Extended Ablations</h2>

<section id="S10.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">10.1 </span>Full Mixing Strategy Grid</h3>

<div id="S10.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S10.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S10.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ 10.1 Full Mixing Strategy Grid ‣ 10 Extended Ablations ‣ The Dual-Stream Transformer: Channelized Architecture for Interpretable Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> presents validation loss for all tested mixing configurations.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S10.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Full mixing strategy ablation (4K vocab, FTS mode, 3 epochs).</figcaption>
<table id="S10.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S10.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S10.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Attention Mixing</th>
