<section id="S11" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">11 </span>Head Specialization Metric</h2>

<div id="S11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Head Specialization Score (HSS) measures how distinctly heads attend to different patterns:</p>
<table id="S11.E18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S11.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{HSS}=\frac{1}{H(H-1)}\sum_{i\neq j}\left(1-\frac{\mathbf{a}_{i}^{\top}\mathbf{a}_{j}}{\|\mathbf{a}_{i}\|\|\mathbf{a}_{j}\|}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HSS</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{HSS}=\frac{1}{H(H-1)}\sum_{i\neq j}\left(1-\frac{\mathbf{a}_{i}^{\top}\mathbf{a}_{j}}{\|\mathbf{a}_{i}\|\|\mathbf{a}_{j}\|}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S11.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S11.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{a}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{a}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> is the flattened attention pattern for head <math id="S11.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> averaged over evaluation samples. HSS <math id="S11.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=0</annotation></semantics></math> indicates identical patterns across all heads; HSS <math id="S11.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=1</annotation></semantics></math> indicates orthogonal patterns.</p>
</div>
</section>
